## Proposed Changes

We will create a new directory inside your workspace named `Web-Converter`.

### [NEW] `Web-Converter/`
- Bootstrapped via `npx create-vite@latest Web-Converter --template react`
- **`src/App.jsx`**: The main interface layout, split between a Settings Sidebar (Resizer, Geotags, Metadata checkboxes) and the Main Grid layout for uploaded images.
- **`src/ImageProcessor.js`**: The pure-JS powerhouse module encapsulating the Canvas-to-PNG transformation and the incredibly tricky EXIF injection techniques.
- **`src/components/ThumbnailNode.jsx`**: A click-able React component that displays the image, with a secondary editor panel that lets you override the metadata independently from the Master Settings.

