## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- The React application runs locally without errors.
- The Custom EXIF injection successfully writes Valid PNG headers without corrupting the Image.

### Manual Verification
- We will start the development server (`npm run dev`).
- Test uploading an image, activating checkboxes.
- Modifying a single thumbnail individually and converting both.
- Uploading the resulting web-converted PNG into FastGeotagger to verify the metadata still magically appears.
